# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-55772650915a6595fc8bc5f1de90182c80e0d2c2 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]].

Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-9fb686e21c6138d4275e0798970b1e72e3612750 "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
